# StructAI MCP — repository hygiene
#
# The rule this file encodes: **commit sources, never environments, never
# runtime state, never secrets.**
#
# Note the two deliberate *inclusions*, which may look unusual:
#   * `MIDAS-API-main/` and `MIDAS-API-NX-SDK-main/` are vendored third-party
#     snapshots and ARE committed (the project owner accepted the provenance
#     caveat — `MIDAS-API-main` ships no LICENSE file). Their upstream URLs are
#     recorded in `README.md`.
#   * `docs/api-registry/*.json` are generated by `docs/api-registry/merge_registry.py`
#     and ARE committed: they are the extracted API research the design documents
#     cite, so a checkout is reproducible without re-running the extraction.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Virtual environments — 103 MB of platform-specific binaries, never portable
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test / tooling caches
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime state — a live database is not source
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
backend/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — the local MIDAS connection config carries a real MAPI-Key
# (project decision: base_url / MAPI-Key / software live in a config *file*).
# Only the template is committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
backend/config/midas.json
backend/config/*.local.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local artefacts that are not deliverables
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A duplicate of the already-committed MIDAS-API-main/ tree.
MIDAS-API-main.zip
# Stray download.
tencent-*.jpg
*.log
